---
title: Rhubarb Cake
author: Mildred McKinzie
category: Desserts
cook time: 40 minutes
source: Loving Memories of Mildred
---

@brown sugar{1.5%cups}
@egg{1}
@milk{1%cup}
@baking soda{1%tsp}
@finely cut up rhubarb{2%cups}
@shortening{0.5%cup}
@salt{1%dash}
@vanilla{1%tsp}
@flour{2%cups}
@sugar/cinnamon mixture

Put in 9x13 inch pan and sprinkle a mixture of sugar/cinnamon on top. Bake for 40 minutes at 350 degrees.
